; between arguments, a comma decimal and \ between array columns, as Excel takes them in ru and uz, with the
English function names. The file still stores SUM(1,2) and 1.5; print_input shows the stored formula in the
entry syntax. Tests: separators, stored form, strings and sheet names holding ; and ,, unions, arrays, round trip.
